This product includes software developed by the PQClean project
(https://github.com/PQClean/PQClean).

The underlying core cryptographic implementations for ML-KEM (Kyber) and 
ML-DSA (Dilithium) are derived from PQClean, which is a collaborative 
effort to provide clean, constant-time implementations of Post-Quantum 
Cryptography.

Portions of the cryptographic core (such as fips202/Keccak and AES) may 
be based on public domain or similarly permissively licensed works as 
cataloged by the PQClean project.
